### 1. Send Custom Topics & Values

This card lets you send custom values to one or several dashboard topics in a single loop without creating multiple Flow cards.

::: code-block
// Define the list of events and values to send
const events = [
  { name: 'kitchen_status', value: 'Occupied' },
  { name: 'energy_warning', value: 'High Usage' }
];

// Loop through each item and send it to Dashboard Studio
for (const item of events) {
  await Homey.flow.runFlowCardAction({
    id: 'homey:app:com.satoer.dashboardstudio:dashboard_send',
    args: {
      name: item.name,
      value: String(item.value)
    }
  });
}

return true;
:::

**How to use it:** Dashboard Studio receives these on topic `homey/event/<name>`. In the editor, select any widget, click the chainlink icon on a setting, and type `kitchen_status` in the topic field.

