### 3. Send Insights & Historical Graphs

Pull historical data for any Homey device or variable, resample it into a lightweight dataset for a [Graph](help://Widgets/graph) widget, and publish it to your dashboard.

This card also calculates and returns the highest, lowest, and average values so you can log them or use them in further script logic.

::: code-block
// Fetch power history for the last 24 hours and send to a graph topic
const result = await Homey.flow.runFlowCardAction({
  id: 'homey:app:com.satoer.dashboardstudio:dashboard_send_insights_advanced',
  args: {
    insight_id: 'homey:device:your-device-id:measure_power',
    time_range: 'last_24_hours',
    datapoints: 24,
    topic: 'living_room_power_history'
  }
});

// Use the calculated metrics directly in your script
log('Average power:', result.insight_average);
log('Peak power:', result.insight_highest);

return true;
:::

