### 5. Display Calendar & iCal Events

Load an iCal or WebCal calendar feed, filter the events to a chosen timeframe, and convert them into a formatted Markdown agenda on your dashboard.

The first card downloads and filters the events. The second card converts the raw data into a clean layout and publishes it to your topic.

::: code-block
// Step 1: Download and filter events for the next 7 days
const calendar = await Homey.flow.runFlowCardAction({
  id: 'homey:app:com.satoer.dashboardstudio:load_filter_ical',
  args: {
    url: 'https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/your-calendar-url/basic.ics',
    target_mode: 'next_7_days'
  }
});

// Step 2: Convert the events into a Markdown agenda and send to the dashboard
await Homey.flow.runFlowCardAction({
  id: 'homey:app:com.satoer.dashboardstudio:webcal_to_markdown',
  args: {
    droptoken: calendar.filtered_events_json,
    format: 'agenda',
    topic: 'family_calendar'
  }
});

return true;
:::

